## Plain HTTP (curl)

```bash
curl -s {{.GraphQLURL}} -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  --data '{"query":"mutation { tesla { createSession(mapID: \"easy\") { id } } }"}'

curl -s {{.GraphQLURL}} -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  --data '{"query":"mutation($id: ID!) { tesla { move(sessionID: $id, direction: RIGHT) { success message gameState { battery playerPos { x y } } } } }","variables":{"id":"SESSION_ID"}}'
```

